<h3><u>Husain o minni wa ana minal hussain</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>HUSSAIN O MINNI WA ANA MINAL HUSSAIN-4<br />
1) Ik roz ka sunate hain (hum tumko waqeya)-2<br />
Baithe hue zami&#39;n pe the SARDAR AMBIYA) -2<br />
ik zanu pe HASSAN the to ek zanu pe HUSSAIN,<br />
Hukm E KHUDA SE kehte hain SARKAR E MASHRAQAIN.<br />
HUSSAIN O MINNI..-2</p>

<p>2) Jis dum suna ye waqeya +ZEHRA ne BAAP se)-2<br />
Boli ye kaun sath me (hoga HUSSAIN k)-2<br />
Koi na hoga FATEMA khoo&#39;n asmaan royega,<br />
Khanjar k niche hoga jab ye mere dil ka chain.<br />
HUSSAIN O MINNI..-2</p>

<p>3) ZEHRA ka rona dekhiye (PAIGHAMBAR E KHUDA)-2<br />
Jo hukm hai KHUDA ka wo (batlaye zara)-2<br />
Ik qaum aisi hogi Jo royegi Tere laal ko,<br />
Hoga karam KHUDA ka bas us par ba zaib O zain.<br />
HUSSAIN O MINNI..-2</p>

<p>4) ASGHAR ko dafn karke jab (utthe SHAH E huda)-2<br />
Karbobala KI Jung&nbsp; ka (naqsha palat dia)-2<br />
Ghabra rahe the sab layi&#39;n chilla rahe the sab layi&#39;n,<br />
Lagta tha jaise aa gaye irfana e HUSSAIN.<br />
HUSSAIN O MINNI.. 2</p>

<p>5) MOLA HUSSAIN karte the (KHALIQ se ye dua)-2<br />
ZAINAB ko sabr dena tu (hai meri iltija)-2<br />
QURA&#39;N ki tarjuman hai ye dee&#39;n ki paasbaan hai,<br />
Sun kar k shams ne kia ro ro k shoro shain.<br />
HUSSAIN O MINNI.. 2</p>

<p>6) Sar ko utha k fakhr&nbsp; se (JIBREEL ne kaha)-2<br />
Bachpan me Jo kia tha wo (wada nibha dia)-2<br />
Deen E KHUDA k waste sher E KHUDA k laal ne,<br />
Sajde me sar sar kata dia ZEHRA ka noor E ain.<br />
HUSSAIN O MINNI.. 2</p>

<p>7) Rumal le ke ayin hai (majlis me SAYYADA)-2<br />
Meesum aza KI bazm me (tu marsiya suna)-2<br />
Maghrab gunah gar hai par tera soghwar hai,<br />
Mehshar me bakhshwana tu MOLA mere HUSSAIN.<br />
HUSSAIN O MINNI WA ANA MINAL HUSSAIN.</p>
